        {
          "text": "So these nations feared the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and also served their graven images; their children likewise, and their children's children—as their fathers did, so they do to this day.",
